<title>USA: Saks Sept same-store sales rise 14.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Saks Sept same-store sales rise 14.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		     1996	   1995    Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $202.4	  n/a     +19.1	+14.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,200.0	  n/a     +17.9	+13.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Company did not provide figures for the year-ago periods, saying their fiscal 1995 year had 53 weeks and is therefore incomparable with the current year.</p>
<p>Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is four weeks ended	   Oct.5.</p>
<p>Full company name is Saks Holding Inc.</p>
</text>
